#1196: the README glmark2 table from one main commit, `0badf00d`

- Toradex Verdin AM62P: score 501; 33 scenes, 0 failed, 0 GL errors, 0 out-of-memory scenes; gl_test 50 of 50; GM `verdict=done`, GT `verdict=done`; 2026-12-01; record `records/am62p/common-0badf00d/`
- Raspberry Pi 4: score 222; 33 scenes, 0 failed, 0 GL errors, 0 out-of-memory scenes; gl_test 50 of 50; GM `verdict=done`, GT `verdict=done`; 2026-12-01; record `records/pi4/common-0badf00d/`
- Toradex Verdin iMX8M Plus: score 77; 33 scenes, 0 failed, 0 GL errors, 0 out-of-memory scenes; gl_test 48 of 48 run passed, 2 skipped; GM `verdict=done`, GT `verdict=done`; 2026-12-01; record `records/imx8mp/common-0badf00d/`

All three boards ran GM (glmark2-es2 800x600) and GT (gl_test) at `0badf00d`: 33 scenes, 0 failed, 0 GL errors, 0 out-of-memory scenes. README.md's table, the three RESULTS.md 'Common set' rows, STATUS.md and website/data.js take these scores. Closes #1196.

